 6 0 0 1-6-6V150a6 6 0 0 1 6-6h74v224c0 26.51 21.49 48 48 48h96v42a6 6 0 0 1-6 6zm128-96H182a6 6 0 0 1-6-6V54a6 6 0 0 1 6-6h106v88c0 13.255 10.745 24 24 24h88v202a6 6 0 0 1-6 6zm6-256h-64V48h9.632c1.591 0 3.117.632 4.243 1.757l48.368 48.368a6 6 0 0 1 1.757 4.243V112z\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n          \u003cspan class=\"check-icon tw-hidden\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"icon\"\n    xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\"\u003e\u003c!-- Font Awesome Free 5.15.4 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) --\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M173.898 439.404l-166.4-166.4c-9.997-9.997-9.997-26.206 0-36.204l36.203-36.204c9.997-9.998 26.207-9.998 36.204 0L192 312.69 432.095 72.596c9.997-9.997 26.207-9.997 36.204 0l36.203 36.204c9.997 9.997 9.997 26.206 0 36.204l-294.4 294.401c-9.998 9.997-26.207 9.997-36.204-.001z\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n      \u003c/button\u003e\n        \n      \u003cbutton \n        class=\"\n          tw-select-none \n          tw-mx-2 \n          tw-block \n          group-[.is-open]:tw-hidden \n          print:!tw-hidden\" \n        disabled\n        aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"icon\"\n    xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\"\u003e\u003c!-- Font Awesome Free 5.15.4 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) --\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M328 256c0 39.8-32.2 72-72 72s-72-32.2-72-72 32.2-72 72-72 72 32.2 72 72zm104-72c-39.8 0-72 32.2-72 72s32.2 72 72 72 72-32.2 72-72-32.2-72-72-72zm-352 0c-39.8 0-72 32.2-72 72s32.2 72 72 72 72-32.2 72-72-32.2-72-72-72z\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/button\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n  \u003c/div\u003e\n  \u003cpre style=\"counter-reset: codeblock;\" class=\"tw-block tw-m-0 tw-p-0\"\u003e\u003ccode \n    id=\"codeblock-id-14\" \n    class=\"\n      chroma \n      !tw-block \n      tw-p-0\n      tw-m-0\n      tw-transition-[max-height] \n      tw-duration-500 \n      tw-ease-in-out \n      group-[.is-closed]:!tw-max-h-0 \n      group-[.is-wrap]:tw-text-wrap\n      tw-overflow-y-hidden\n      tw-overflow-x-auto\n      tw-scrollbar-thin\n      \"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003ecp themes/even/exampleSite/config.toml hugo.toml\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003ch3 id=\"create-a-blog-post\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#create-a-blog-post\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e2.4 Create a Blog Post\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eOnce the theme is configured, you can create your own blog post.\nUse \u003ccode\u003ehugo new content/content/post/my-first-post.md\u003c/code\u003e to create a blog post.\nYou can see that a new md file will appear under \u003ccode\u003econtent/post/\u003c/code\u003e after executing this command.\n\u003cimg class=\"tw-inline\" loading=\"lazy\" src='/b6760e2f47eed1c8a962e475f69adc92_6518912847253113034.png' srcset=\"/b6760e2f47eed1c8a962e475f69adc92_6518912847253113034_hu_c908f4a048ec6bfd.webp 800w, /b6760e2f47eed1c8a962e475f69adc92_6518912847253113034_hu_7092bcbf99a0ee4d.webp 1200w, /b6760e2f47eed1c8a962e475f69adc92_6518912847253113034_hu_2b1bb50e77a786c7.webp 1600w\"  alt=\"my-first-blog\" height=\"388\" width=\"1964\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 id=\"run-hugo\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#run-hugo\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e2.5 Run Hugo\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eOnce the previous configurations are done, you can start a Hugo server using \u003ccode\u003ehugo server\u003c/code\u003e.\n\u003cimg class=\"tw-inline\" loading=\"lazy\" src='/69da7f70c3795f266a83207d186d0ad4_9992074773452968849.png' srcset=\"/69da7f70c3795f266a83207d186d0ad4_9992074773452968849_hu_d9462c556b9f2119.webp 800w, /69da7f70c3795f266a83207d186d0ad4_9992074773452968849_hu_15c617f96a6621e3.webp 1200w, /69da7f70c3795f266a83207d186d0ad4_9992074773452968849_hu_9bc46078d9bbf8d2.webp 1600w\"   height=\"940\" width=\"2668\"\u003e\nClick the link to access the blog website address.\n\u003cimg class=\"tw-inline\" loading=\"lazy\" src='/10ebbce59ca6637b1b44c8d884c471bd_12237597648526076018.png' srcset=\"/10ebbce59ca6637b1b44c8d884c471bd_12237597648526076018_hu_1f1bf16699b99098.webp 800w, /10ebbce59ca6637b1b44c8d884c471bd_12237597648526076018_hu_2096cbff401a9792.webp 1200w, /10ebbce59ca6637b1b44c8d884c471bd_12237597648526076018_hu_165078f3ac1361a6.webp 1600w\"   height=\"1484\" width=\"2364\"\u003e\nAt this point, you will notice that the previously created blog does not appear; the reason is that the blog created earlier is set as \u003ccode\u003edraft\u003c/code\u003e, and it will not be displayed in \u003ccode\u003ehugo server\u003c/code\u003e mode.\nTo show it, you need to use \u003ccode\u003ehugo server -D\u003c/code\u003e.\n\u003cimg class=\"tw-inline\" loading=\"lazy\" src='/72c092d59ad8143fa61188eac94ace32_2161862008488115701.png' srcset=\"/72c092d59ad8143fa61188eac94ace32_2161862008488115701_hu_71eb6cc2b9e896c3.webp 800w, /72c092d59ad8143fa61188eac94ace32_2161862008488115701_hu_bddacba46e149443.webp 1200w, /72c092d59ad8143fa61188eac94ace32_2161862008488115701_hu_e32d99c8d313790b.webp 1600w\"   height=\"1052\" width=\"3528\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith this, you can complete the setup of your blog website.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 id=\"save-the-local-blog-to-github\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#save-the-local-blog-to-github\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e2.6 Save the Local Blog to GitHub\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLog in to GitHub and create a new repository (e.g., heyjude-blog).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdd the local repository as a remote:\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"code-block highlight is-open show-line-numbers  tw-group tw-my-2\"\u003e\n  \u003cdiv class=\"\n    \n    tw-flex \n    tw-flex-row\n    tw-flex-1 \n    tw-justify-between \n    tw-w-full tw-bg-bgColor-secondary\n    \"\u003e      \n    \u003cbutton \n      class=\"\n        code-block-button\n        tw-mx-2 \n        tw-flex\n        tw-flex-row\n        tw-flex-1\"\n      aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\n          \u003cdiv class=\"group-[.is-open]:tw-rotate-90 tw-transition-[transform] tw-duration-500 tw-ease-in-out print:!tw-hidden tw-w-min tw-h-min tw-my-1 tw-mx-1\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"icon\"\n    xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\"\u003e\u003c!-- Font Awesome Free 5.15.4 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) --\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M285.476 272.971L91.132 467.314c-9.373 9.373-24.569 9.373-33.941 0l-22.667-22.667c-9.357-9.357-9.375-24.522-.04-33.901L188.505 256 34.484 101.255c-9.335-9.379-9.317-24.544.04-33.901l22.667-22.667c9.373-9.373 24.569-9.373 33.941 0L285.475 239.03c9.373 9.372 9.373 24.568.001 33.941z\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003cp class=\"tw-select-none !tw-my-1\"\u003etext\u003c/p\u003e\n      \u003c/button\u003e\n\n   \u003cdiv class=\"tw-flex\"\u003e\n      \u003cbutton \n        class=\"\n          line-number-button\n          tw-mx-2 \n          tw-hidden \n          group-[.is-open]:tw-block \n          group-[.show-line-numbers]:tw-text-fgColor-link \n          print:!tw-hidden\" \n        title=\"Toggle line numbers\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"icon\"\n    xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\"\u003e\u003c!-- Font Awesome Free 5.15.4 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) --\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M61.77 401l17.5-20.15a19.92 19.92 0 0 0 5.07-14.19v-3.31C84.34 356 80.5 352 73 352H16a8 8 0 0 0-8 8v16a8 8 0 0 0 8 8h22.83a157.41 157.41 0 0 0-1